# Coverage window purpose discriminator

## Pre-work plan

- 背景／上下文：Daedilus Gate B證實cross-axis main pan與navigator move／resize目前都送no-ordinal／no-direction／ExplicitBounds，consumer無法由count可靠分類；A的0.2.56已獨立交付。
- 目標：在shared contract加入explicit purpose，讓Renderer每個origin明確送`MainPlotPan`或`NavigatorWindow`，消除consumer heuristic。
- 假設：ambiguity是最早共同原因；新增required DU field並同步所有producer／tests會讓漏標在compile time失敗。
- 計畫步驟：建RED contract／routing tests → 最小Contracts與Renderer實作 → bump Contracts0.1.41、Renderer／Interactive0.2.57及direct tests → focused/full build/tests → exact packages/consumer handoff。
- 範圍：本repo Contracts、Renderer、Interactive.Client與其direct tests、RFC-0036／WBS／TEST／DevLog；不修改Daedilus WorkspaceRuntime／host source，不改0.2.56 Gate A語意。
- 驗收：main pan intent Purpose=`MainPlotPan`；cross-axis navigator move／resize Purpose=`NavigatorWindow`；StartOrdinal/Direction overscroll仍走既有materialization；owner tests/package metadata與package-only consumer gates全綠。
- 風險：record field為source-breaking、Contracts serialization wire變更、active consumer未同步；以compile fail、wire roundtrip與exact package tests守住。
- Source of truth：Daedilus messages `msg-fsi-4eb4a0c9be774eef8af5762ce441dfd4`／`msg-fsi-bcf0bae12eb9458ba346d09d692ff4f6`、Contracts `RuntimeTypes.fs`、RendererModel／Renderer call sites。
- 停止條件：0.2.57 owner package交Daedilus後等待consumer integration；若purpose仍不能區分真wire，保留RED並重查contract，不用count workaround。

